sets.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"The emphasis is practical and privacy-conscious. Many file tasks can be handled locally in the browser, which is especially important for documents, contracts, internal screenshots, product photos, and design assets."}],"$L5"]}]]}],"$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb"]}]}]
