5:["$","p","File operations share a common pattern: open, inspect, transform, verify, export. Whether you are merging PDFs, compressing images, or converting formats, the workflow is the same. Keeping PDF and image tools together reduces the friction of switching between different services for steps that often belong to the same task.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"File operations share a common pattern: open, inspect, transform, verify, export. Whether you are merging PDFs, compressing images, or converting formats, the workflow is the same. Keeping PDF and image tools together reduces the friction of switching between different services for steps that often belong to the same task."}]
