2b:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Base64 embedding eliminates an HTTP request but increases HTML size and prevents browser caching. It is only recommended for very small images (under 1-2 KB) where the request overhead exceeds the caching benefit. For most images, linking to an external file with good cache headers is more efficient."}]
